  "content_html": "<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/assets/images/content/0352cbb60e412587c1.png\" style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 1em; outline: none; padding: 0px; transition: all; vertical-align: baseline;\"><img alt=\"רישום של ילד עם כובע מצחייה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"291\" data-original-width=\"219\" src=\"/assets/images/content/0352cbb60e412587c1.png\" style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; margin: 0px; max-width: 100%; outline: none; padding: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: none; vertical-align: baseline;\" /></a></p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">🎈&nbsp;</span><span data-end=\"108\" data-start=\"73\" style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">שיחה בציורים - היכן נמצאת התורה?</span></span></span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;👦 <strong data-end=\"133\" data-start=\"121\">הַיֶּלֶד</strong>:<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שָׁלוֹם! אֲנִי רוֹצֶה לִקְנוֹת כַּרְטִיס טִיסָּה לַשָּׁמַיִם. שָׁם בְּוַדַּאי נִמְצֵאת הַתּוֹרָה!</span></span></p>\n<p data-end=\"353\" data-start=\"238\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">✈️ <strong data-end=\"267\" data-start=\"241\">הַדַּיֶּלֶת בַּשָּׁעָר</strong>:<br data-end=\"271\" data-start=\"268\" />\nאֵין טִיסָּה לַשָּׁמַיִם, חָבִיבִי. וּבְכָל מִקְרֶה – הַתּוֹרָה לֹא בַשָּׁמַיִם.</span></p>\n<p data-end=\"450\" data-start=\"355\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">👦 <strong data-end=\"370\" data-start=\"358\">הַיֶּלֶד</strong>:<br data-end=\"374\" data-start=\"371\" />\nטוֹב... אָז אֶקַּח אֳנִיָּה גְדוֹלָה! אֶעֱבֹר אֶת הַיָּם וְאָבִיא אוֹתָהּ.</span></p>\n<p data-end=\"539\" data-start=\"452\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🚢 <strong data-end=\"469\" data-start=\"455\">הַקָּפְטֵן</strong>:<br data-end=\"473\" data-start=\"470\" />\nלֹא צָרִיךְ לַחֲצוֹת אֶת הַיָּם. הַתּוֹרָה לֹא מֵעֵבֶר לַמַּיִם.</span></p>\n<p data-end=\"621\" data-start=\"541\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">👦 <strong data-end=\"556\" data-start=\"544\">הַיֶּלֶד</strong>:<br data-end=\"560\" data-start=\"557\" />\nאָז אֶעֱלֶה עַל רַכֶּבֶת מַהִירָה , אֶסַּע&nbsp;לְסוֹף הָעוֹלָם!</span></p>\n<p data-end=\"699\" data-start=\"623\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🚂 <strong data-end=\"639\" data-start=\"626\">הַקַּטָּר</strong>:<br data-end=\"643\" data-start=\"640\" />\nאֵין צֹּרֶךְ.&nbsp;הַתּוֹרָה לֹא נִמְצֵאת בְּסוֹף הַמְּסִלָּה.</span></p>\n<p data-end=\"825\" data-start=\"701\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">👦 <strong data-end=\"716\" data-start=\"704\">הַיֶּלֶד</strong>:<br data-end=\"720\" data-start=\"717\" />\nנוּ, אֲזַי אֶרְכַּב עַל גָּמָל וְאֶעֱבֹר אֶת הַמִּדְבָּר, עַד שֶׁאֶגִּיעַ לַמָּקוֹם הָרָחוֹק בְּיוֹתֵר!</span></p>\n<p data-end=\"931\" data-start=\"827\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🐪 <strong data-end=\"842\" data-start=\"830\">הַגָּמָל</strong>:<br data-end=\"846\" data-start=\"843\" />\nגָּמָל אוֹ גָּמָלִית – זֶה לֹא הַדֶּרֶךְ. הַתּוֹרָה לֹא בַּמִּדְבָּר.</span></p>\n<p data-end=\"1001\" data-start=\"933\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">👦 <strong data-end=\"948\" data-start=\"936\">הַיֶּלֶד</strong> (מִתְיָאַשׁ קְצָת):<br data-end=\"971\" data-start=\"968\" />\nאָז... אֵיפֹה הִיא בֶּאֱמֶת?</span></p>\n<p data-end=\"1115\" data-start=\"1003\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">📖 <strong data-end=\"1029\" data-start=\"1006\">הַסֵּפֶר הַפָּתוּחַ</strong>:<br data-end=\"1033\" data-start=\"1030\" />\nכָּאן! \"כִּי קָרוֹב אֵלֶיךָ הַדָּבָר מְאֹד – בְּפִיךָ וּבִלְבָבְךָ, לַעֲשֹׂתוֹ\".</span></p>\n<p data-end=\"1246\" data-start=\"1117\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">👦 <strong data-end=\"1132\" data-start=\"1120\">הַיֶּלֶד</strong> (בְּתוֹךְ חִיּוּךְ גָּדוֹל):<br data-end=\"1164\" data-start=\"1161\" />\nכָּל הַזְּמַן הָיְתָה הַתּוֹרָה כָּאן, בְּתוֹכִי? מַמָּשׁ לְיַד הַלֵּב וּבַפֶּה?</span></p>\n<p data-end=\"1359\" data-start=\"1248\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">📖 <strong data-end=\"1263\" data-start=\"1251\">הַסֵּפֶר</strong>:<br data-end=\"1267\" data-start=\"1264\" />\nבְּוַדַּאי! לֹא טִיסָּה, לֹא אֳנִיָּה, לֹא רַכֶּבֶת וְלֹא גָּמָל – אֶלָּא אַתָּה עַצְמְךָ.</span></p><p data-end=\"2562\" data-start=\"2384\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">תפזורת מקצועית</span></span></h2></div><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">מצאו את&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; font-weight: bold; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">🔍</strong><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;האנשים המוזכרים בפרשה: רָאשִׁים, זְקֵנִים, שׁוֹטְרִים, נָשִׁים, גֵּרִים, חוֹטְבִים, שׁוֹאֲבִים</span></span></span></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">.</span></span></span></div><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">בכיוונים&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">⬅️ ➡️ ⬇️ ⬆️</span></span></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/68ae92d0b3bd081480.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"459\" data-original-width=\"466\" height=\"315\" src=\"/assets/images/content/68ae92d0b3bd081480.png\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br /><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" /></div><p data-end=\"984\" data-start=\"883\" style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; font-size: medium; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span></p><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><div style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">נכון או לא בפרשה?</span></span></h2></span></div><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; font-size: medium; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><p style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p></span></div><p data-end=\"171\" data-start=\"93\" style=\"text-align: right;\"></p><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">חֻרְבַּן אֶרֶץ יִשְׂרָאֵל בָּא כְּתוֹצָאָה מֵעֲזִיבַת הַתּוֹרָה?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַשָּׁמַיִם וְהַיָּם הֵם הָעֵדִים לְאַזְהָרָה ה' עַל שְׁמִירַת הַתּוֹרָה?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ה' הִבְטִיחַ לְקַבֵּץ אֶת יִשְׂרָאֵל מִכָּל אַרְצוֹת הָעוֹלָם?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַתּוֹרָה נִמְצֵאת מֵאֲחוֹרֵי הַמִּדְבָּר הַגָּדוֹל?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כְּדֵי לְהַגִּיעַ אֶת הָאָרֶץ - הָיוּ צְרִיכִים בְּנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל לַחֲצוֹת אֶת הַיַּרְקוֹן?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּאֶפְשָׁרוּת עַם יִשְׂרָאֵל לִבְחֹר בַּדֶּרֶךְ הָרָעָה - אֲבָל אָז יֵעָנְשׁוּ?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בַּפָּרָשָׁה כָּתוּב: אֶת הַחַיִּים וְאֶת הַטּוֹב וְאֶת הַמָּוֶת וְאֶת הַשִּׂמְחָה?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַיְּלָדִים נִקְרָאִים בַּפָּרָשָׁה \"פְּרִי בִּטְנְךָ\"?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַפֵּרוֹת נִקְרָאִים בַּפָּרָשָׁה \"פְּרִי גִּנָּתְךָ\"?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ה' מַבְטִיחַ לְקַבֵּל אֵלָיו אֶת מִי שֶׁשָּׁב בִּתְשׁוּבָה?</span></li></ol><p></p>"
}
